    "title": "Hiring Strength and Conditioning Coach | Killington Mountain School - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Press Release ,\n8 hours ago Location: Killington Mountain School, Killington, Vermont. Killington Mountain School (KMS) seeks a Strength and Conditioning Coach to lead the design, implementation, and delivery of individualized athletic performance programming for student-athletes. Working closely with sport coaches, the Strength and Conditioning Coach develops year-round training programs that enhance athletic performance, reduce injury risk, and support long-term athlete development. Read full article",
